entries[1236209] = { ["name"] = "Glacial Spike", ["text"] = "1% of base mana 40 yd range\n2.75 sec cast\nConjures a massive spike of ice, and merges your current Icicles into it. It impales your target, dealing (654% of Spell Power) damage plus all of the damage stored in your Icicles, and freezes the target in place for 4 sec. Damage may interrupt the freeze effect.\n\nRequires 5 Icicles to cast.\n\nPassive: Ice Lance no longer launches Icicles." }
